          "key": "clementine.letter-6",
          "text": [
            "Dear friend by the fire,\n\nThey are taking my hourglass away tomorrow to be mended, so this is my last letter, and I am sorry, because I liked having someone to write to.\n\nTake my book down and warm page eighteen at the fire. You'll know what to say.\n\nYour friend, C.A."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "starts": [
